{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "03", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "08", "M": "58", "S": "06"}}, "news": [{"title": "Land survey on; Dharani, Bhu Bharati inquiry will be on fast-track: Telangana minister", "para": "The government is investigating fraudulent land mutations and occupations on government property.  Land transactions from the Dharani and Bhu Bharati portals are being reviewed quickly.  Culprits involved in large-scale land fraud will face legal consequences.  Survey work is complete in 276 villages for assigning unique Bhoodhar numbers.  A comprehensive policy decision is needed for the state's 85,000 acres of assigned land.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/telangana-government-fast-tracks-land-fraud-inquiry-amidst-allegations-of-corruption/132817934?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-313216/132817934.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Draft plan-2047 notified for Patliputra greenfield township; land transaction curbs lifted", "para": "Bihar government has notified the Draft Development Plan-2047 for Pataliputra Satellite Township. This move lifts land transaction restrictions, accelerating development and attracting investment. The draft plan invites public objections and suggestions within sixty days for finalization. This project aims to create a modern, sustainable urban center for future needs. The initiative aligns with the state's vision for planned and organized urban growth.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/patliputra-greenfield-township-draft-plan-2047-unveiled-land-transaction-curbs-lifted-for-accelerated-development/132817899?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1788777/132817899.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title"